{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21180","headline":"忆云之 · 元稹","name":"忆云之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲鱼实爱泉，食辛宁避蓼。\n人生既相合，不复论窕窕。\n沧海良有穷，白日非长皎。\n何事一人心，各在四方表。\n泛若逐水萍，居爲附松茑。\n流浪随所之，萦纡牵所绕。\n百龄颇局促，况复迷寿夭。\n芟发君已衰，冠岁予非小。\n娱乐不及时，暮年壮心少。\n感此幽念绵，遂爲长悄悄。\n中庭草木春，历乱递相扰。\n奇树花冥冥，竹竿凤褭褭。\n幽芳被兰径，安得寄天杪。\n万里潇湘魂，夜夜南枝鸟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}